WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.433
Run the capture script.

2
00:00:02.483 --> 00:00:07.558
It builds Kettle, boots the simulator, installs the app,

3
00:00:07.608 --> 00:00:14.766
then opens each registered screen by launch argument and takes a screenshot of it.

4
00:00:14.816 --> 00:00:16.768
When it finishes,

5
00:00:16.818 --> 00:00:22.824
.scry/capture holds one image per screen and a small manifest file.

